  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI Gitau Six Degrees Consultancy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Business Services / Fisheries .Beneficiaries; YALI Youth 261 of which 181 are women. ..The grant will be used to offer business development services in Siaya County on how to form and join organized groups for collective investment into fish cage farming model with special emphasis on women participation. Six Degrees Consultancy will train beach management units on alternative investments models for revenue generation in the value chain. The goal of the project is to increase food security through better fish production and formalize at least 50 small-scale informal fisheries. . .The grant funds will be used to: (a) increase working capital of fish and fish feed; (b) administrative support to field team; and (c) conduct monitoring and evaluation. .</narrative>
  </description>
